    "detailed_description": "Humanity has become the dominant force in the world, and the devils are living under the cover of their names...<br>Are you really willing? The world is being dominated by evil human beings!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In this game you can experience:</h2><br>1. Unusual plot and world outlook.<br>2. Lead four characters to conquer mazes and checkpoints.<br>3. Operating with different enemies in the tower.<br>4. Choose the opponent you are about to encounter and the one you don't want to encounter.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You can operate the game like this:</h2><br>1. Enter full screen mode and exit through F4.<br>2. Move the position of the person by clicking on the direction key or the mouse.<br>3. Determine your choice by using the Enter key or the left mouse button.<br>4. Layout your rounds in battle through the Skills Panel.<br>5. Combat efficiently by remembering commands.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Why did we make this game: </h2><br>Falsemen: Demon Rebirth is a complete reproduction of Rescue the Great Demon. The original is a personal game created by Yesenmidnight in June 2015.<br>The rebirth edition retains the elements of &quot;tower&quot; and &quot;floor&quot; in the original edition, and has been completely reproduced in the plot, characters, art, music, procedures and other aspects.<br>Falsemen DR is a pre-production of Falsemen III, which is about to meet with you. In order to let you better understand the game world outlook, we have made this re-creation.<br>On the other hand, this creation is also to solve the shortfall of funds for the development of Falsemen III. For Now, we've spent all our money.<br><br><strong>All the revenue from the sale of Falsemen DR will be used for the development of Falsemen III.</strong><br><br>Wish you enjoy our game.",
